OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Foften clear this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, turning chilly with a touch
OL,8,Fof frost in places. The odd mist and
OL,9,Ffog patch also possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMainly dry and bright with
OL,12,Foccasional sunny breaks. Cloudier at
OL,13,Ftimes through the Lothians and Borders
OL,14,Fwith isolated showers. Winds will be
OL,15,Flight and variable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
